  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Substances A and B are initially in the gas state. The substances have the same mass. Energy is removed from the substances at a constant rate. The graph shows how the temperature of each substance varies with time. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>How do the specific heat capacities in the liquid state and the specific latent heats of vaporization compare for the two substances?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Specific heat capacities</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Specific latent heats of vaporization</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c_{A}&gt;c_{B}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L_{A}&gt;L_{B}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c_{A}&gt;c_{B}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L_{A}&lt;L_{B}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c_{A}&lt;c_{B}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L_{A}&gt;L_{B}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c_{A}&lt;c_{B}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L_{A}&lt;L_{B}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
